stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Created

    Created --> Created: ValidateConfig 失败<br/>(kConfiguration，可改配重试)
    Created --> Running: 首个 Start 成功<br/>(transport.Start + MarkRunning<br/>+ spawn 读循环/handler)
    Created --> Created: 并发 Start<br/>(await start_done_，不重复 spawn)

    Running --> Running: 再次 Start（幂等成功）
    Running --> Closing: 首个 Close<br/>(汇合信号 + FailAll<br/>+ 放行读循环收敛)
    Running --> Closing: 致命错误自终<br/>(读循环退出时仍 Running →<br/>自发同一组汇合信号，ADR-0005 D5)

    Closing --> Closing: 后续 Close<br/>(共享 closed_，多等待者)
    Closing --> Closed: 读循环收敛完成<br/>(读循环退出→等 handler 退出<br/>→close_drop→Closed)

    Closed --> Closed: 再次 Close（直接成功）
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Closing
        无重入守卫（ADR-0006 D8）：Close 结尾
        无条件等 closed_。内部工作单元不走这里
        —— 处理器经 RequestClose 只发信号不等待，
        读循环收敛走内部路径。捕获 node* 硬调
        Close 会挂死，属使用契约（RT_LIFECYCLE_005）
    end note

    note right of Running
        Request/Send 仅在 Running 放行；
        Created/Closing/Closed 一律 kClosed
    end note
